<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 894)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>When delivered media can&#8217;t be fetched, the review copies are offered</b> &#8212; once, in plain words: the same encrypted copies a browser gets, lighter than the originals, fine for notes and timing, not for judging pixels; the originals can be fetched later from Review &#8250; Network&#8230;. Say yes and the review carries on.</li>
<li>A delivery that fails says so and adds that people can still watch review copies.</li>
<li>Manual: the invite&#8217;s media choices, delivering from the Share window, Connections, and the review-copies offer.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
